ugh daily and weekly tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <strong>ON GOLF’S BIGGEST STAGES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Take on legends like Tiger Woods or step into their shoes and feel what it’s like to master some of the hardest courses in the world. In a PGA TOUR 2K franchise first, test your grit at The PGA Championship, U.S. Open and The Open Championship. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> YOUR CAREER. YOUR LEGACY. YOUR WAY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Dynamically simulate rounds, train for tournaments, and evolve your player through new Attribute Point and Equipment Progression systems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong> SEASONS. BACK AND BETTER THAN EVER.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Earn rewards, climb the Ranked leaderboards, and experience regular content updates. Progress at your own pace through past Seasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>PGA TOUR 2K25: AIM FOR GREATNESS</strong></p>", "short_description": "Take your best shot at glory in PGA TOUR 2K25! In a 2K-first, compete in three prestigious major tournaments. Personalize your game with expanded MyCAREER, MyPLAYER and Course Designer options. Challenge friends across ranked, casual, and cross-platform multiplayer.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385530/header.jpg?t=1783526355", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385530/0da4393a00dc8bbf857cd725fb45814be20546a7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783526355", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2385530/0da4393a00dc8bbf857cd725fb45814be20546a7